        "paragraph": "<p>In a recent study examining the effectiveness of different teaching methods on student performance in mathematics, researchers focused on two specific approaches: traditional lecture-based instruction and interactive problem-solving sessions. The hypothesis posited that students participating in interactive problem-solving sessions would demonstrate significantly higher test scores compared to those taught through traditional lectures. To evaluate this, the researchers measured the final exam scores of students from two classes—one utilizing traditional methods and the other employing interactive techniques. The results were analyzed to determine the impact of the teaching methodology on student achievement, with a focus on whether the interactive method indeed leads to better performance in mathematics.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"568.11pt\" height=\"425.335716pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 568.11 425.335716\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" version=\"1.1\">\n <metadata>\n  <rdf:RDF xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:cc=\"http://creativecommons.org/ns#\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\">\n   <cc:Work>\n    <dc:type rdf:resource=\"http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/StillImage\"/>\n    <dc:date>2026-03-04T23:25:03.781202</dc:date>\n    <dc:format>image/svg+xml</dc:format>\n    <dc:creator>\n     <cc:Agent>\n      <dc:title>Matplotlib v3.10.8, https://matplotlib.org/</dc:title>\n     </cc:Agent>\n    </dc:creator>\n   </cc:Work>\n  </rdf:RDF>\n </metadata>\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">*{stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-linecap: butt}</style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 425.335716 \nL 568.11 425.335716 \nL 568.11 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill: #ffffff\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 50.81 336.957636 \nL 560.91 336.957636 \nL 560.91 23.077969 \nL 50.81 23.077969 \nz